{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31145","headline":"题褒城驿池 · 薛能","name":"题褒城驿池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池馆通秦槛向衢，旧闻佳赏此踟蹰。\n清凉不散亭犹在，事力何销舫已无。\n钓客坐风临岛屿，牧牛当雨食菰蒲。\n西川吟吏偏思葺，只恐归寻水亦枯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}